          "suspectLines": [
            {
              "line": 1,
              "text": "Oligomycin is a competitive inhibitor of the F0 complex and blocks oxidation and phosphorylation by stopping the flow of protons through the ATP synthase complex. It binds to the F0 domain, closes the proton channel, prevents re-entry of protons into the matrix, and stops phosphorylation of ADP to ATP.",
